%% Guest associations
A_Guest --> UC_Register
A_Guest --> UC_VerifyEmail
A_Guest --> UC_Login
A_Guest --> UC_ResetPassword

%% Student associations
A_Student --> UC_Logout
A_Student --> UC_ViewProfile
A_Student --> UC_EditProfile
A_Student --> UC_UploadPicture
A_Student --> UC_CreatePost
A_Student --> UC_EditOwnPost
A_Student --> UC_DeleteOwnPost
A_Student --> UC_LikePost
A_Student --> UC_CommentPost
A_Student --> UC_CreateEvent
A_Student --> UC_EditOwnEvent
A_Student --> UC_DeleteOwnEvent
A_Student --> UC_ViewEvents
A_Student --> UC_JoinEvent
A_Student --> UC_LeaveEvent
A_Student --> UC_CommentEvent
A_Student --> UC_ShareEvent
A_Student --> UC_CreateClub
A_Student --> UC_JoinClub
A_Student --> UC_LeaveClub
A_Student --> UC_CreateConversation
A_Student --> UC_CreateGroup
A_Student --> UC_SendMessage
A_Student --> UC_ReceiveMessage
A_Student --> UC_ShareAttachment
