A_Student --> UC_LeaveTrip
A_Student --> UC_TripChat
A_Student --> UC_ViewNotifications
A_Student --> UC_MarkRead
A_Student --> UC_SearchStudents
A_Student --> UC_SearchClubs
A_Student --> UC_SearchEvents
A_Student --> UC_ReportContent

%% Club leader associations (in addition to inherited student actions)
A_Leader --> UC_EditManagedClub
A_Leader --> UC_ManageMembers
